    "rich_text_p7D8ce": {
      "type": "rich-text",
      "blocks": {
        "heading_MrGjAB": {
          "type": "heading",
          "settings": {
            "title": "FAQs: Bulk Pillar Candles",
            "heading_tag": "h2",
            "heading_font_class": "fs-heading-2-base"
          }
        },
        "border_JMAjFR": {
          "type": "border",
          "settings": {}
        },
        "text_phgQQw": {
          "type": "text",
          "settings": {
            "text": "<p>Below, we've answered a few common questions about our bulk pillar candles. Please <a href=\"https://kiscocandles.com/pages/contact-us\"><span style=\"text-decoration:underline\">contact us</span></a> if you'd like additional information.</p>",
            "text_font_class": "fs-body-100"
          }
        },
        "subheading_jRWLhL": {
          "type": "subheading",
          "settings": {
            "subheading": "What makes your bulk pillar candles a great choice for events and businesses?",
            "subheading_tag": "h3",
            "subheading_font_class": "fs-heading-6-base"
          }
        },
        "text_cVFhCr": {
          "type": "text",
          "settings": {
            "text": "<p>Our bulk candles are made by a company called Bolsius. They're known for their high-quality craftsmanship and features that appeal to business owners and their patrons.<strong> Bolsius bulk candles are dripless, smokeless and unscented, making them ideal for various events and venues. </strong>Their long burn time and clean appearance ensure that your décor remains flawless throughout the event.</p>",
            "text_font_class": "fs-body-75"
          }
        },
        "subheading_fVaWkq": {
          "type": "subheading",
          "settings": {
            "subheading": "Do bulk pillar candles come in different sizes?",
            "subheading_tag": "h3",
            "subheading_font_class": "fs-heading-5-base"
          }
        },
        "text_xVMDY7": {
          "type": "text",
          "settings": {
            "text": "<p>Yes,<strong> bulk pillar candles are available in various widths (between 2\" and 3\") and heights (up to 9\") to suit different needs.</strong> From large statement pieces to smaller candles for intimate settings, we have high-quality, affordable pillar candles to illuminate your space.</p>",
            "text_font_class": "fs-body-75"
          }
        },
        "subheading_63Jihh": {
          "type": "subheading",
          "settings": {
            "subheading": "Can I order customized quantities for bulk purchases?",
            "subheading_tag": "h3",
            "subheading_font_class": "fs-heading-5-base"
          }
        },
        "text_dttHE3": {
          "type": "text",
          "settings": {
            "text": "<p>Absolutely! <strong>Through our wholesale program, we provide flexible bulk order options so you can customize the quantities to fit your specific needs for any event or business setup.</strong></p>",
            "text_font_class": "fs-body-75"
          }
        }
      },
      "block_order": [
